<title>UK: Oce v.d.Grinten sets 250 million guilder 10yr bond.</title>
<headline>Oce v.d.Grinten sets 250 million guilder 10yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OCE VAN DER GRINTEN</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.375 PCT MATURITY    28.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.675    SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  HOLLAND   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED JUNE 2006 AND JAN 2007 DSLS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
